[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_4_EE_TO]
> Enter the Equestria Empire Venue

[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_4_EE_TO_desc]
Due to the busy domestic affairs of the empire, they did not prepare too many exhibits, but you can learn about the culture of the Equestria Empire here: there is a special reading area in the exhibition hall, which only contains copies of a single book “Neo-harmonism Explained”.

(There is a line of conspicuous large characters below: Do NOT bring the books from the art venue here to read! Even if there are no other creatures reading here, it is NOT allowed!)

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_4_EE_TO]
> 前往小马利亚帝国会场

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_4_EE_TO_desc]
由于帝国的国内事务繁忙，他们并没有准备太多展品，但是你可以在这里了解到小马利亚帝国的文化：展馆内有专门的图书阅读区，仅包含《新谐律主义思想》一本书的复印本。

（下面写着一行醒目的大字：禁止将艺术馆的图书带至此处阅读！即使这里没有别的生物在读书，也不行！）
